% NEGATIVE TEST SET (deliberately violating). Loaded ON TOP of the real facts + contracts.
% Every fact below is a violation the contracts MUST flag; the driver compares the flagged
% constraint ids with the EXPECT-IC line and fails if any is not flagged ("the check bites").
% None of these facts are data; they are synthetic test inputs and are never emitted by gen_facts.sh.
% EXPECT-IC: dc_required_check_missing_or_not_pass dc_audit_check_failed dc_device_min_out_of_range dc_device_max_out_of_range dc_zero_imputation_signature dc_imputation_applied dc_first_valid_outside_utc_day dc_last_valid_outside_utc_day dc_unknown_device dc_source_tree_dirty dc_physical_without_provenance dc_synthetic_as_physical dc_second_csv_not_declared inv_nz_empty_valid_set inv_nz_empty_policy inv_entropy_as_bits inv_h1_requirement_unmet inv_h1_without_holdout inv_candidate_asserted_h1 tp_test_without_null tp_test_without_correction tp_reported_test_has_no_result tp_preregistration_unbacked tp_fixed_seed_missing cl_unclassified cl_status_not_allowed cl_status_without_claim cl_verified_and_hypothesis cl_verified_and_unverified cl_hypothesis_and_unverified cl_verified_without_evidence cl_verified_evidence_failed cl_verified_formal_proof cl_verified_replication cl_verified_scientific_hypothesis cl_verified_tool_absent cl_verified_depends_on_unrun_test cl_hypothesis_without_plan cl_unverified_without_reason cl_h1_verified_without_holdout pol_component_without_declared_kind pol_forbidden_runtime_kind pol_runtime_input_to_sampler pol_llm_text_hit_asserted pol_consciousness_claim_asserted pol_simulation_claim_asserted pol_forbidden_assertion pol_causal_without_observers pol_candidate_named_consciousness pol_no_proof_implies_consciousness pol_event_without_independent_source pol_event_synthetic pol_event_without_utc pol_event_count_nonzero pol_event_data_file_undeclared pol_observer_labels_in_csv

